Subject: [PATCH] bcm2835: extract owned pending and claim steps

Preserve ack diagnostics, mapping arithmetic, registered-handler dispatch and trailing EOI. Outer global ownership remains unresolved.

Agent: Codex
Model: gpt-6-sol
Provider: OpenAI
Refs: perplexity-redox-hourly-safety-check
---
 .../aarch64/device/irqchip/irq_bcm2835.rs     | 144 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 97 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/arch/aarch64/device/irqchip/irq_bcm2835.rs b/src/arch/aarch64/device/irqchip/irq_bcm2835.rs
index 0da1c585..636e8d15 100644
